<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 04:53:15 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>弗朗西斯·福山谈为什么我们比我们的祖先更好</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/francis-fukuyama-on-why-were-better-than-our-ancestors</link><description>1849 年，查尔斯·狄更斯讲述了他如何亲眼目睹数千人聚集在南华克，观看一对夫妇被绞死。人群开始唱一首歌。他们唱了一首流行曲子——“哦！苏珊娜”——并把歌词换成了死刑犯。就像足球场里的一群人喝醉了啤酒和大众建议一样，每个人都玩起了绞刑游戏。众人笑得多么开心。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 04:53:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/francis-fukuyama-on-why-were-better-than-our-ancestors</guid></item><item><title>新理论解释了为什么大脑右侧控制身体左侧</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/new-theory-explains-why-the-right-side-of-the-brain-controls-the-left-side-of-the-body</link><description>我们大脑的左侧部分控制身体的右侧部分（反之亦然），而来自右侧的感觉输入则在大脑的左侧进行处理（反之亦然）。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 04:38:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/new-theory-explains-why-the-right-side-of-the-brain-controls-the-left-side-of-the-body</guid></item><item><title>哥德尔和刘易斯·卡罗尔揭示现实是无法解释的</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/godel-and-lewis-carroll-revealed-that-reality-is-inexplicable</link><description>数学常常被误认为是一门快速计算和精确答案的学科。然而数学本质上并不是算术。从最深层次来说，数学是一门&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 04:23:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/godel-and-lewis-carroll-revealed-that-reality-is-inexplicable</guid></item><item><title>确定了功能不同的星形胶质细胞亚型！</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/functionally-distinct-astrocyte-subtypes-identified</link><description>“我们很早就知道星形胶质细胞承担许多重要的工作。它们帮助神经细胞沟通，保持大脑回路运行，滋养神经细胞并维持保护大脑的血脑屏障，并对损伤和疾病做出反应。但尚不清楚特定的工作是否由特定类型的星形胶质细胞执行，就像神经元的情况一样，”通讯作者说。&lt;img src="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-11186-z" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 04:08:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/functionally-distinct-astrocyte-subtypes-identified</guid></item><item><title>能源公司部署可以跨接电线充电的无人机 — NOMAD 四轴飞行器无人机无需回家即可监控电网，记录时间超过 20,000 小时，每架监控 25 公里的电网</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/energy-companies-deploy-drones-that-can-recharge-by-straddling-power-lines-nomad-quadcopter-drones-can-monitor-the-grid-without-ever-returning-home-log-over-20000-hours-and-monitor-25km-o</link><description>NOMAD 是可以降落在带电高压线路上、从线路本身充电并重新定位以准备执行下一个任务的无人机。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 03:53:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/energy-companies-deploy-drones-that-can-recharge-by-straddling-power-lines-nomad-quadcopter-drones-can-monitor-the-grid-without-ever-returning-home-log-over-20000-hours-and-monitor-25km-o</guid></item><item><title>与原子结合的同样的力可能蕴藏着暗能量的秘密</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/the-same-force-that-binds-atoms-may-hold-the-secret-to-dark-energy</link><description>该提案以量子色动力学 (QCD) 为中心，这是描述&lt;img src="https://interestingengineering.com/science/string-theory-dark-energy-driving-universe-expansion" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 03:38:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/the-same-force-that-binds-atoms-may-hold-the-secret-to-dark-energy</guid></item><item><title>由于电解质形成了自己的屏蔽层，无阳极钠电池的使用寿命更长</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/anode-free-sodium-batteries-last-longer-thanks-to-an-electrolyte-that-forms-its-own-shield</link><description>一些能源研究人员也一直在探索在没有钠金属阳极的情况下组装的钠电池，称为无阳极钠电池。在这些电池中，源自阴极（即电池放电时的正极）的钠离子在充电期间获得电子并以钠金属的形式沉积到薄金属集电器上，形成阳极。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 03:23:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/anode-free-sodium-batteries-last-longer-thanks-to-an-electrolyte-that-forms-its-own-shield</guid></item><item><title>混合纳米晶体表面揭示了调节与红外光相互作用的新方法</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/hybrid-nanocrystal-surface-reveals-new-way-to-tune-interactions-with-infrared-light</link><description>这种薄片被称为超表面，包含随机混合的纳米晶体（由掺杂 1% 或 3% 锡的氧化铟制成），它们彼此相互作用并与红外光相互作用，产生超线性光学效应。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 03:08:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/hybrid-nanocrystal-surface-reveals-new-way-to-tune-interactions-with-infrared-light</guid></item><item><title>罗伯特·萨波尔斯基 |建立西方文明的神话</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/robert-sapolsky-the-myth-that-built-western-civilization</link><description>如果西方文明赖以建立的理念——我们是自由的个体，对我们的选择、成功和失败负责——从根本上来说是错误的怎么办？&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 02:53:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/robert-sapolsky-the-myth-that-built-western-civilization</guid></item><item><title>宇宙中有多少粒子？ — 数字爱好者</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/how-many-particles-in-the-universe-numberphile</link><description>由 Skillshare 赞助...前 500 人免费 2 个月：&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 02:38:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/how-many-particles-in-the-universe-numberphile</guid></item></channel></rss>